599 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 542 0 R
/E (The American Red Cross Central and South Texas Region serves 83 counties, home to over 9.4 million people. For centuries, the American Red Cross has utilized volunteers in every corner of the region to provide hope and comfort to their neighbors in crisis. The Red Cross urges communities to prepare for, respond to, and recover from emergencies large and small. The services that the American Red Cross offers include disaster relief and preparedness, lifesaving CPR and first aid training, international family tracing, and support for military, veterans, and their families. The Central Texas chapter serves people facing emergencies every day, embracing the diversity of staff, volunteers, and people they serve. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
