939 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 559 0 R
/E (A different word\(s\) will be posted everyday, 5 days a week for 4 weeks. The social media stories will show a video of an ASL-fluent individual signing and thoroughly explaining the word\(s\), accompanied by hand-drawn animations. Each week will have a different topic that the words will follow. To start off September with general ASL terms, week one will be Essential Phrases, and week 2 will be Introduction and Small Talk. )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
