/E (To kick off our campaign, we've strategically chosen September, which coincides with National Deaf Awareness Month. This significant month will mark the debut of our first animation \(DOG\). Alongside this, we'll be implementing a Search Engine Marketing \(SEM\) initiative. Building on this momentum, we'll launch our "Sign of The Day" Instagram campaign, leading to the Crepe Crazy Event and the introduction of the Crepe of the Month at various locations.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [63]
>>
endobj
1221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 575 0 R
/E (In October, we will monitor and optimize our Search Engine Marketing efforts. Our "Sign of The Day" Instagram campaign will run throughout the first half of the month, five days a week. October also encompasses Fire Prevention Week, we'll actively engage with Facebook groups, promoting our bed shakers through compelling messaging and infographics. Additionally, we will be kickstarting the collaboration between Red Cross Central Texas and the Deaf Culture Alliance \(DCA\).)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [64]
>>
endobj
1222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 575 0 R
/E (Starting with our third and final animation, November will focus on the collaboration between Red Cross Central & South Texas and the Deaf Culture Alliance \(DCA\). This partnership will feature highlights spotlighting DCA officers. Additionally, we will actively post and promote resources within targeted)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [65]
>>
endobj
