3921 0 obj
<<
/Title (The primary audience for the American Red Cross is the Deaf and Hard of Hearing \(DHH\) community. These individuals include hearing people engaged in the cause, Sign Language Interpreters and translators, and friends and other relatives. With 1 in 20 people being deaf or hard of hearing, our predominant focus is the DHH individuals who are seeking emergency technology to navigate natural disasters. Our secondary priority is the friends and family members of DHH individuals because this audience is an integral part that affects the lives of the DHH community. Our last and tertiary focus is American Sign Language interpreters. All of these audiences are connected by the technology, accessibility, and resources the American Red Cross offers. We further developed our target audience by creating three personas that best represent the individuals we are trying to connect with:)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3917 0 R
/Next 3926 0 R
>>
